WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:09.390
Iyi videwo isobanura uburyo wakoresha Arclight kugirango ukore fonctionnement yumutuku uhitamo urumuri rwinshi.

2
00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:16.650
Menya neza ko lens rack iri hejuru, ahatagira ingufu za lens mu mwobo wo kureba.

3
00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:22.010
Ku burebure bw'ukuboko, reba reflex mumaso yombi icyarimwe.

4
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:26.750
Gereranya umucyo n'ibara hagati y'amaso yombi.

5
00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:35.290
Mu isuzuma risanzwe, ntihakagombye kubaho itandukaniro rusange mumucyo namabara hagati y'amaso yombi.

6
00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:42.120
Mu bana bera na Aziya, reflex irashobora kugaragara cyane orange n'umuhondo.

7
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:50.500
Ibigaragara biracyari byose nkibisanzwe muri rusange ibara numucyo ni kimwe hagati y'amaso yombi.

8
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:58.980
Reflex idasanzwe ni mugihe hari itandukaniro rihoraho, itandukaniro nyaryo mumucyo namabara hagati y'amaso yombi.

9
00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:10.890
Ibi birashobora kuba imitekerereze ya corneal yimuwe, igicucu cyijimye kiboneka muri refleks yijisho rimwe cyangwa amaso yombi, cyangwa refleks itukura idahari rwose.

10
00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:25.670
Ikizamini kidasanzwe cya reflex kirashobora kwerekana ko hariho cataracte, retinoblastoma, inkovu ya corneal, squint, cyangwa ikosa ryanga.

11
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:29.970
Ibi byose bisaba ko hasuzumwa izindi mpuguke.
